    "insights": [
      "Nat.mod_mod_of_dvd: if m|M then (x%M)%m = x%m — key for showing x%M satisfies all congruences",
      "Uniqueness: x≡y[MOD M] + both<M gives x=y via Nat.mod_eq_of_lt",
      "Minimal solution = any_solution % moduliProd sys — reduction preserves all congruences",
      "moduliProd [] = 1 (empty product), so M>0 trivially holds for empty system",
      "Sunzi problem: unique minimal solution x=23 in [0,105) verified by native_decide"
